SkillNest – Assets Folder
==========================

This project does not depend on any external image files. All visuals
(the hero illustration, icons, and avatars) are built using pure CSS
and emoji characters, so the site works immediately with no missing
image errors.

If you'd like to add your own images later (e.g. a logo image, team
photos, or custom icons), place them in this folder and reference them
from index.html like this:

  <img src="assets/your-image.png" alt="Describe the image here">

Recommended additions if you extend this project:
  - logo.png       (SkillNest logo, if you don't want to use the CSS logo mark)
  - favicon.ico     (browser tab icon — link it in <head> with a <link rel="icon"> tag)
  - og-image.png    (social media preview image)
